roid and web(as it should be) when project path is valid.\r\n- tooltip is visible again.\r\n\r\nAs I see, this is regression from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/74729 which is included into every 4.x release except 4.0.x - setting tooltip and icon (+its visibility) was moved to `set_is_missing()` and `if (project_is_missing == p_missing)` check was added which leads to skipping function for not missing projects.\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n| ![Godot_v4 4-rc2_win64_cBOv2zsk1Q](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0cbba235-9167-4bd8-9a42-f16c5d0b7e31) | ![godot windows editor x86_64_n3jy8riLAa](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/23a8e02b-b57b-4b14-8f1d-a7c468c2b781) |","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7008779076,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABocF7RA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.3","name":"cherrypick:4.3","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.3.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://